the process values recorded:
E: values #[env:FOO]
Pl: values #[]
FOO=1 as when E was compiled:
E: command 0: kept
E: command 1: kept
FOO=2:
E: module refused: the process value env:FOO is not what it was when the module was compiled
FOO unset:
E: module refused: the process value env:FOO is not what it was when the module was compiled
E compiled with FOO unset, then FOO=1:
E: module refused: the process value env:FOO is not what it was when the module was compiled
a file of the toolchain read:
Tc: command 0: kept
Tc: command 1: kept
a path under the toolchain that resolves outside it, and a relative path:
Es: noreuse reason: declaration command 0: an effect outside the command: it reads TOOLCHAIN/bin/../..
Rel: noreuse reason: declaration command 0: an effect outside the command: it reads X.lean
BAR read by an imported module's initializer, BAR=1 as when IV was compiled, then BAR=2:
IV: command 0: kept
IV: module refused: the process value env:BAR is not what it was when the module was compiled
